      "contextFingerprint": "f5cbdfb4827e28e770437333148a1557b652d5e91380347299e2b8a79a699b89",
      "sourceText": "| 示例 | 讲了什么 | 新出现的语法 | 为什么这样写 | 注意事项 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| 示例 1 | 基础模块定义和导入 | `export module`、`import`、`export` | 模块只暴露 export 的内容 | 模块文件名没有硬性规定，`.cppm` 是社区惯例 |\n| 示例 2 | 模块中导出类 | `export class`、`import <string>` | 类的 public/private 仍然有效 | `import <header>` 属于 header unit，工具链支持差异较大 |\n| 示例 3 | 接口单元和实现单元分离 | `module counter;` | 接口只暴露声明，实现放到单独文件 | 构建系统要知道模块依赖关系 |",
      "translatedText": "| Example | What was discussed | Newly introduced syntax | Why it is written this way | Notes |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| Example 1 | Basic module definition and import | `export module`、`import`、`export` | A module only exposes what is exported | There is no hard rule for module file names,`.cppm` is a community convention |\n| Example 2 | Exporting classes from a module | `export class`、`import <string>` | Class public/private is still valid | `import <header>` belongs to a header unit, and toolchain support varies significantly |\n| Example 3 | Separating interface units and implementation units | `module counter;` | The interface exposes only declarations, while the implementation is placed in a separate file | The build system needs to know module dependencies |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 242,
        "outputTokens": 142,
        "costUsd": 0.000243
      }
    },
